  "description": "Agent402 MCP server. Agent402 is a catalog of 500+ tools that AI agents find, pay for per request over x402 or MPP, and call with no account or API key. The applied layer of Agentic Finance: skill packs too, USDC or USDG on 14 chains, or free via proof-of-work. Catalog: browser, web search + cited answers, PDFs, OCR, images, LLM inference, image generation, code execution, STT, embeddings, live financial/crypto/macro data, SEC EDGAR filings, deterministic stats & forecasting, compression, payments. Open source, self-hostable.",
